<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Chile's CAP upped to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chile's CAP upped to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Santander Investment analyst Catalina Le Blance has raised her rating for Chilean steelmaker CAP SA to buy from market perform.</p>
<p>-- In an April 23 report, she set a 12- to 18-month price target of 1,350 pesos, a 17 percent rise from current levels. She forecast a 12 percent return for the overall Chilean market.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company were up 10 pesos to 1,140 in Santiago.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
